  "description": {
   "en": "One day, high school girl Kamishiro Tsumugi suddenly becomes a boy...?!\nA new everyday life begins with her female childhood friend and the boys in her class.\nThis is a different story, set in the same world as '[Zenbu Kimi no Sei](https://mangadex.org/title/82476383-e6a9-41a7-b98c-87cc8be9efbb/zenbu-kimi-no-sei)'",
   "ja": "女子高生の神代紬（かみしろつむぎ）は、ある日突然男の子になってしまった…!?\n幼馴染の女の子や同級生の男の子達との、新しい日常が始まる。\n「[ぜんぶきみの性](https://mangadex.org/title/82476383-e6a9-41a7-b98c-87cc8be9efbb/zenbu-kimi-no-sei)」と同じ世界線で描かれる、別の物語です。"
